  "description": "WhatsApp Cloud API webhook of every clinic number: /webhook/wa/<channel account id>. GET = Meta verification (verify token = account webhook secret); POST = X-Hub-Signature-256 checked with the platform app secret (Crypto node, raw body), then messages and button replies are ingested. The sender phone is proved by WhatsApp, so ingest_message glues the client to an existing verified profile with the same phone (P1)."
